# Generated app bundles (built from Neovide by bin/build-bundle, not committed)
*.app

# Editor / tooling. Skills are versioned with the app they encode; the rest
# of .claude/ is machine-local. Listed as .claude/* rather than .claude/
# because git never descends into an excluded directory, so a negation
# inside one has no effect.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
lazy-lock.json
